From 9a67614b73d1cb91f3c2b61c394902003a328b62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:11:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 41/48] Reply to viewers from the danmaku feed; keep the
 floating chat on top
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Danmaku replies: "回复 @TA" in the feed's right-click menu (or a double
click) sets a reply target shown above the send box; the danmaku is sent
with the viewer's uid and the target danmaku id, as the web room and
LiveHime for Windows do. Incoming replies show as "@name" in the feed and
the overlay; chat events now carry dmid and replyTo.

Floating chat on top: Qt drops Qt::Tool windows to the normal level when
the app is inactive, so other apps covered the chat, and another app's
full-screen Space only admits non-activating panels. The chat window is
now a non-activating panel while "置顶" is on and gets its floating level
back after activation changes. e2e-float-fullscreen.mjs covers both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
