+`e2e-float-fullscreen.mjs` checks "置顶" against other apps: a probe app goes
+full screen in its own Space and the chat must be in front of it (and absent
+with "置顶" off); then the probe covers the chat with a normal, active window
+and the chat must stay in front at the floating level. The probe takes over
+the screen for a few seconds per case:
+
+```bash
+swiftc -O fullscreen-probe.swift -o /tmp/fullscreen-probe
+node e2e-float-fullscreen.mjs <websocket password> <LiveHime pid> /tmp/fullscreen-probe
+```
+
 ## Cover manager check
 
